1
00:00:06,041 --> 00:00:07,881
(Penny:)Hey, you're up early.

2
00:00:08,043 --> 00:00:10,113
(Sheldon:)I couldn't sleep.

3
00:00:10,278 --> 00:00:14,188
(Penny:)I told you those Walking Dead
pillowcases were a bad idea.

4
00:00:14,316 --> 00:00:16,226
(Sheldon:)No, that's not it.

5
00:00:16,385 --> 00:00:17,885
(Penny:)Is something bothering you?

6
00:00:18,053 --> 00:00:20,863
(Sheldon:)Yes, but you wouldn't understand.

7
00:00:21,023 --> 00:00:23,163
(Penny:)Come on, try me.

8
00:00:24,192 --> 00:00:26,142
(Sheldon:)All right.

9
00:00:28,130 --> 00:00:30,740
(Sheldon:)I've devoted the prime
of my life to string theory

10
00:00:30,899 --> 00:00:34,749
(Sheldon:)and its quest for the
compactification of extra dimensions.

11
00:00:34,903 --> 00:00:38,073
(Sheldon:)I've got nothing to show for it,
and I feel like a fool.

12
00:00:39,141 --> 00:00:41,021
OK. I get it.

13
00:00:41,176 --> 00:00:43,346
(Penny:)I mean, not all the jibber-jabber
in the middle, but...

14
00:00:45,213 --> 00:00:47,253
(Penny:)...I know what it's like to put your
heart and soul into something

15
00:00:47,416 --> 00:00:48,916
(Penny:)and get nothing out of it.

16
00:00:49,584 --> 00:00:51,084
(Sheldon:)You mean your acting career?

17
00:00:53,221 --> 00:00:55,931
(Raj:)-No.
-Your relationship with Leonard?

18
00:00:57,426 --> 00:00:58,496
(Raj:)No.

19
00:00:58,660 --> 00:01:00,070
(Sheldon:)Your failed attempt
to go back to college?

20
00:01:00,228 --> 00:01:02,018
No!

